# Architecture

`ytmusic_tui.music.types` must not import Textual, VLC, yt-dlp, or Peewee.

Adapters (yt-dlp, VLC, Peewee) implement the protocols in `ytmusic_tui.music.ports`. Services take those protocols. The TUI calls services and reads `AppState`.

`AppState` holds shared observables (`current_song`, `current_user`, `current_playlist`, `playback_state`). Widgets subscribe on mount and unsubscribe on unmount.

Search, stream resolution, and disk I/O run in `@work(thread=True)`, not on the Textual event loop.
